 Abuse Teladoc Services. This would include seeking multiple consultations within the same day for the same reason without any reason that would warrant a repeat visit, for example requesting multiple consultations to get a prescription that was not deemed appropriate during a first visit. Do not, however, hesitate to seek medical care or advice through the appropriate Teladoc Service or through emergency or other in-person care whenever necessary. 

